// The Windows application icon, compiled and linked by build.rs.
//
// Ordinal 1 is deliberate twice over: it is the first icon group in the file,
// which is what Explorer and the taskbar show for the exe, and it is the
// resource gpui asks the module for by name (MAKEINTRESOURCE(1)) when it sets
// the window class icon. icon.ico is rendered from icon.png, which is the
// coding-agent's web/icons/icon-512.png byte for byte.
1 ICON "icon.ico"
